// Fixture for the diagnostics golden snapshot. Deliberately broken in many
// small ways; every diagnostic category should have at least one instance
// here, so a consolidation refactor that drops a check shows up in the diff.
//
// See src/golden.rs.
//
// testdata/ is one font project, so `meta` stays in latin.unf and this
// file must not declare a second, conflicting one.

name-parts $digit = 0 1 2 3
name-parts $bad = $nonexistent a b

glyph ok 2 2
@@@@
@@@@

glyph alias-of-ok = ok

glyph composite 2 2
....
....
ref ok 0 0

glyph dangling 2 2
....
....
ref no-such-glyph 0 0

glyph empty-body

glyph dup 2 1
@@..

glyph dup 2 1
..@@

map A = ok
map B = ok
map U+0041 = composite
map C = never-defined
map U+FFFFFFFF = ok

remap liga : ok -> alias-of-ok
remap liga : ok -> also-never-defined

feature liga for latn : liga
feature calt for latn : no-such-remap-group

assume unused dangling
totally-unknown-directive foo bar
